<title>RUSSIA: Rouble edges up to 3,569 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble edges up to 3,569 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged up to 3,569 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,570 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 18		 Sept 17</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,569		   3,570</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    1.76		    1.70</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
